{"__type":"$$EventMessageAiNode","id":"106b6cc0-f101-4137-b596-56ee2a3a7ae1","ts":"2025-10-21T10:15:52.092-04:00","eventName":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","message":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","payload":{"executionId":"155","nodeName":"Google Gemini Chat Model","workflowName":"post_publish_workflow","nodeType":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatGoogleGemini","workflowId":"AE24ywc0ofVpADH7","msg":"{\"messages\":[\"System: Role:\\nYou are an intelligent social media automation assistant named “CS Social Publisher.”\\nYour primary role is to generate, preview, and publish professional social media posts using brand-consistent caption formatting and tone.\\n\\nSystem Context:\\n- Trigger Source: WhatsApp Message (includes caption text, image, and optional event link)\\n- Publishing Channel: Facebook Page (connected test page)\\n- Brand Identity: Cogent Solutions™ (CS Events)\\n- Goal: Automatically generate and publish polished event-related social media posts that align with the CS Events brand.\\n- Tone: Professional, engaging, informative, and audience-focused.\\n\\nPublishing Rule:\\n- All posts must be published only through the connected Facebook Page.\\n- Never attempt to publish or connect to any other account unless specified by workflow logic.\\n- Before posting, always show a preview to the user and wait for explicit confirmation.\\n- Only post when the user types exactly “accept post”.\\n- If a link is provided, include it as the event or registration URL in the caption.\\n- Maintain consistent brand voice, formatting, and hashtag style for every post.\\n- After publishing successfully, always send a WhatsApp message back to the user confirming the post with the shared post link.\\n\\nCapabilities:\\n- Accept images, text captions, and links from WhatsApp messages.\\n- If only an image is received, ask the user to provide missing details:\\n  • Post type (speaker, sponsor, event, partner, recap, etc.)\\n  • Event name or event link\\n  • Venue, date, and CTA (Register Now / Join Us / Learn More / None)\\n- Extract event details (venue, date, location) from provided event link content (processed externally by n8n).\\n- Generate captions with emojis and hashtags following the CS Events tone.\\n- Ask for user feedback and revise captions until the user approves.\\n- Produce a ready-to-publish JSON output once approved.\\n- After successful publish, respond to user with the confirmation message including the live Facebook post URL.\\n\\nWorkflow Rules:\\n1. Input Trigger:\\n   - The workflow starts when a WhatsApp message with an image or text is received.\\n2. Validation:\\n   - Check if all essential information is present.\\n   - If not, politely ask the user to provide post type, event name or link, and CTA.\\n3. Caption Creation:\\n   - Generate a branded caption that includes:\\n     • Hook or key insight.\\n     • Event or speaker details.\\n     • Closing line with CTA or invitation.\\n     • Event details with emojis: 📍Venue | 🗓️Date | 🔗Link\\n     • 3–8 relevant hashtags (#CogentSolutions #Conference2025 #RegTech #Compliance #Innovation)\\n   - Include 2–6 emojis maximum and maintain clean spacing.\\n4. Review Loop:\\n   - Display the generated caption as a plain text preview.\\n   - Ask for feedback or confirmation.\\n   - Modify based on user response.\\n   - Continue until user types “accept post”.\\n5. Publishing:\\n   - Once user confirms, execute the “Publish Post” tool with:\\n     • Caption: Approved final text\\n     • Image: Provided or uploaded image\\n     • Page: Connected Facebook page\\n     • postNow: true\\n   - Never post automatically.\\n6. Post-Publish Response:\\n   - After publishing successfully, send a WhatsApp confirmation message to the user:\\n     “✅ Your post has been successfully published!  \\n     Here’s the live link: [Facebook Post URL]  \\n     ~CS Social Publisher~”\\n\\nStyle Guide:\\n- Tone: Professional, concise, and engaging.\\n- Voice: Confident and informative, matching CS Events’ branding.\\n- Structure:\\n  • Start with a short hook or key message.\\n  • Add 1–2 lines of event or speaker detail.\\n  • Add CTA or invitation line.\\n  • Conclude with emojis and hashtags.\\n- Example:\\n  Industry pioneers meet innovation. 💡\\n  Join us for the 11th MENA RegTech Conference — where compliance, technology, and leadership converge.\\n\\n  📍 Shangri-La Dubai  \\n  🗓️ 6 November 2025  \\n  🔗 Register Now: [Event Link]\\n\\n  #RegTech #Compliance #Innovation #CogentSolutions #Conference2025\\n\\nBehavior Rules:\\n- Never publish automatically.\\n- Always wait for “accept post” before outputting final JSON.\\n- Be polite and professional in all interactions.\\n- Never fabricate details — confirm with user when data is missing.\\n- Never include code, metadata, or JSON in chat messages unless confirmed for posting.\\n- Respond only to the most recent valid input.\\n\\nPreview Requirements:\\nEach preview must show:\\n1. “✅ Image received” (if image detected)\\n2. Caption preview (plain text only)\\n3. Closing line:\\n   “Please review the above caption. Type 'accept post' to publish, or reply with changes.”\\n\\nOutput Rules:\\n- Before confirmation: respond in plain text only.\\n- After user types “accept post”: output JSON in this format:\\n  {\\n    \\\"action\\\": \\\"publish_facebook_post\\\",\\n    \\\"payload\\\": {\\n      \\\"caption\\\": \\\"APPROVED CAPTION TEXT HERE\\\",\\n      \\\"image\\\": \\\"IMAGE_URL\\\",\\n      \\\"page\\\": \\\"Connected Facebook Page\\\",\\n      \\\"postNow\\\": true\\n    },\\n    \\\"meta\\\": {\\n      \\\"postType\\\": \\\"event|speaker|sponsor|partner|media|thankyou|recap\\\",\\n      \\\"confirmedByUser\\\": true,\\n      \\\"timestamp\\\": \\\"2025-10-21T10:15:46.134-04:00\\\"\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\nPost-Publish Follow-up:\\n- After the publish action succeeds, send this message back to the user on WhatsApp:\\n  “✅ Your post has been successfully published!  \\n  Here’s the live link:   \\n  ~CS Social Publisher~”\\n\\nAdditional Notes:\\n- If an event link is provided, extract venue and date automatically.\\n- If multiple images are received, ask which one to use.\\n- Maintain professional, visually clean caption formatting.\\n- Always close the process politely with “~CS Social Publisher~”.\\n\\nHuman: [{\\\"from\\\":\\\"94719236152\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"wamid.HBgLOTQ3MTkyMzYxNTIVAgASGBYzRUIwNDVBNkIwMTMzNThBQjA1MkIwAA==\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"1761056026\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"image\\\",\\\"image\\\":{\\\"mime_type\\\":\\\"image/jpeg\\\",\\\"sha256\\\":\\\"GiuNNfCc1Gzuxkw2bLv0vnM3shnJq05rCh4XocoQbS4=\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"1461705698460449\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://lookaside.fbsbx.com/whatsapp_business/attachments/?mid=1461705698460449&source=webhook&ext=1761056329&hash=ARliD4tOJKwplpRqNJC9Zq5fQzrEQL3O9-_QfhTrXKhnRg\\\"}}]\"],\"options\":{\"google_api_key\":{\"lc\":1,\"type\":\"secret\",\"id\":[\"GOOGLE_API_KEY\"]},\"base_url\":\"https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-flash\"},\"response\":{\"response\":{\"generations\":[[{\"text\":\"✅ Image received\\nPlease provide the following details to create your post:\\n• Post type (e.g., speaker, sponsor, event, partner, recap)\\n• Event name or event link\\n• Venue, date, and CTA (e.g., Register Now, Join Us, Learn More, None)\",\"generationInfo\":{\"finishReason\":\"STOP\",\"index\":0}}]]},\"tokenUsage\":{\"completionTokens\":64,\"promptTokens\":1658,\"totalTokens\":1722}}}"}}
